nst Smile Power in a game of basketball. They've done their homework and accurately identify RISE's weakness. Can RISE win and perform their first on-stage song?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-07-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4u9MoVwuEcekhnGug34fcLzvChq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4u9MoVwuEcekhnGug34fcLzvChq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/157345/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"3828291","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"One of the prizes that RISE earned is Nono, a robot assistant who quickly settles in as the team's manager. RISE also meets May-Bee, Kanagawa's strongest and most popular team.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-07-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lXGmdXVeXuQDeuoizxymY9Z8YF1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lXGmdXVeXuQDeuoizxymY9Z8YF1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/157345/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"3828292","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hiyori meets Yukino at a batting cage. Yukino is a powerful slugger, skilled catcher, and talented singer, but insists she cannot join the team due to family reasons. What could that reason be?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-08-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b3ZBYHiZOKge2FRRoFRyNNgBqFY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b3ZBYHiZOKge2FRRoFRyNNgBqFY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/157345/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"3828293","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":